1) Student Class and Object
class Student {
    String name;
    int rollNo;

    void display() {
        System.out.println("Student Name: " + name);
        System.out.println("Roll Number: " + rollNo);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Student s1 = new Student();

        s1.name = "Shiny";
        s1.rollNo = 5264;

        s1.display();
    }
}
Output
Student Name: Shiny
Roll Number: 5264

2) Employee Class and Object
class Employee {
    String name;
    double salary;

    void showDetails() {
        System.out.println("Employee Name: " + name);
        System.out.println("Salary: " + salary);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Employee e1 = new Employee();

        e1.name = "Priya";
        e1.salary = 35000;

        e1.showDetails();
    }
}
Output
Employee Name:Priya
Salary: 35000.0
